### Pengujian REST API & Sanctum Auth
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### 1. Register User Baru
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Agus Seputra",
    "email": "agus@yahoo.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login (Mendapatkan Bearer Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "password"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Cek Profil (Sanctum Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. GET Products Tanpa Token (Harus 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Accept: application/json

### 6. GET Semua Produk (Dengan Bearer Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. GET Detail Produk ID 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. POST Tambah Produk Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "OK Computer",
    "artist": "Radiohead",
    "format": "Vinyl LP (180g)",
    "description": "Album legendaris Radiohead tahun 1997.",
    "category_id": 1,
    "price": 520000,
    "stock": 10
}

### 9. PUT Update Produk ID 1
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "AM (Deluxe Edition)",
    "artist": "Arctic Monkeys",
    "format": "Vinyl LP (180g)",
    "description": "Album studio kelima legendaris Arctic Monkeys.",
    "category_id": 1,
    "price": 540000,
    "stock": 20
}

### 10. DELETE Hapus Produk ID 1
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
